# Football Prediction League App

This is a mobile-first football prediction app where friends compete in private leagues by predicting exact match scores. Target launch: World Cup 2026 (June 11, 2026).

## Key Context Files
- `docs/PROJECT.md` - full product spec, scoring system, screens, user flows
- `docs/TECH_STACK.md` - stack, architecture, project structure
- `docs/DATABASE.md` - complete schema with all tables, types, and RLS policies

## Stack Summary
- Next.js 16 (App Router) + TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui (dark theme, designed via v0)
- TanStack Query v5 for client data fetching
- Supabase (Auth, Postgres with RLS, Realtime, Edge Functions)
- football-data.org v4 API for match data and live scores
- Deploy on Vercel

## Critical Rules
- **v0 owns all design** -- never manually write component styles or globals.css. Pull from v0.
- Server Components by default. Only `"use client"` for interactive elements.
- All Supabase queries in client components go through TanStack Query hooks in `src/hooks/`.
- Dark theme only. Mobile-first. No light mode.
- Predictions must be hidden from other users until match kickoff (RLS enforced).
